{
	"$schema": "clod-theme/target@1",
	"family": "goblin",
	"target": "html",
	"extends": "goblin.json",
	"rationale": {
		"mapping_notes": "Direct token copy of all twelve roles plus the material extras (desk, blot, slip, card, slime, tape, exhibit), each under its palette name. The one transformation: blot and tape are opaque hex in the core (every reader of a core expects 6-digit hex) and get their alpha here, blot at 16% light and 35% dark, tape at 90% in both, as the notice drew them; --gradient is the three-stop core gradient at 135deg. Two extra type tokens, --font-print and --font-marker, carry the slip and marker voices, and --wonk / --wonk-2 carry the hand-drawn border radii. google_fonts is deliberately empty: Jason chose to self-host the five faces (OFL, via @fontsource) so a page makes no third-party request; the consumer loads the files and these tokens only name the families. --rag-a, --rag-b and --rag-c are the three torn-paper outlines from the core shape block, used as clip-path on a slip's backing layer (added 2026-11-19 for the mod pages). 'Noto Sans Runic' follows the first face in the body, mono and print stacks (added 2026-11-20): none of the five faces has the Runic block, and the skills wing quotes the glyph convention's runes, so the consumer self-hosts its runic subset, which a browser fetches only for a page that holds a rune."
	},
